'<p>',
'This page provides an Interactive Grid for managing products using the <strong>EBA_DEMO_JSON_PRODUCTS</strong> JSON source. It allows users to view, add, edit, and delete product records while seamlessly handling the <strong>product_details</strong> '
||'JSON column. The grid demonstrates how relational data and JSON content can be managed together in a single interface, enabling interactive exploration and updates without requiring full JSON restructuring.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'To get started, browse the product records in the Interactive Grid or create a new product entry. ',
'You can directly edit relational fields and JSON-based product attributes, then save your changes to see how both structured and semi-structured data are managed together within Oracle APEX.',
'</p>'))
