'This page provides a faceted search experience for support tickets using the <strong>EBA_DEMO_JSON_SUPPORT_TICKET</strong> JSON source. Users can filter tickets by status, priority, and creation date range, with results displayed as cards and highlig'
||'hted using color-coded status badges.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'To get started, use the faceted search filters to refine the displayed tickets. Each card includes a <strong>Details</strong> button that opens the full support ticket information.',
'</p>'))
