,p_plug_source=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'<h2>About this Application</h2>',
'<p>',
'This Oracle APEX application demonstrates how to work with JSON data using modern Oracle Database features. It provides a structured and intuitive environment to explore JSON sources, transform data, and present it through rich and interactive compon'
||'ents.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
'The application showcases key capabilities such as JSON columns, JSON collection tables, and SQL/JSON functions, combined with relational duality views to bridge structured and semi-structured data. This enables a consistent and flexible data model w'
||'hile maintaining performance and scalability.',
'</p>',
'',
'<p>',
